OL,3,GNEWSABoy arrested following Bradley
OL,4,ALowery taunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of a public order offence and
OL,8,Fsubsequently bailed, after a video on
OL,9,Fsocial media appeared to show a
OL,10,FCoventry City fan taunting opposition
OL,11,FSunderland fans with a photo of Bradley
OL,12,FLowery.
OL,14,FSunderland fan Bradley, who died aged
OL,15,Fsix in 2017 after being diagnosed with
OL,16,Fa rare childhood cancer, captured the
OL,17,Fhearts of the football world.
OL,19,FThe 14-year-old handed himself into
OL,20,FWest Midlands Police, who said they
OL,21,Fwere investigating the incident.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
